{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>וימלאום</b> — twice here. And the other וימלאום at the king Saul passage, regarding the one hundred foreskins of the Philistines — a hint to that which they place the foreskin in the dust. Another interpretation: because Avimelekh violated his oath and filled the wells with dust, David filled for Saul 100 foreskins of Philistines doubled and gave him 200 in place of 100."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:02.487677156Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}